REM ============================================
REM TurboAVR Installation Script
REM ============================================
REM 
REM This script adds turboAVR.exe to the system PATH
REM allowing you to run turboAVR from any directory.
REM 
REM Usage: Run this batch file as administrator
REM 
REM After installation, you can use:
REM   turboAVR yourfile.c
REM 
REM from any directory containing your AVR projects.
REM ============================================

SET "PATH=turboAVR.exe;%PATH%"